              "text": "Gk Old Latin: Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Moab and Seir",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " said, Behold, the house of Judah is like all the other nations, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "therefore I will lay open the flank of Moab from the cities",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25.9",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "cities from its cities",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " on its frontier, the glory of the country, Beth-jeshimoth, Baal-meon, and Kiriathaim. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will give it along with the Ammonites to the people of the East as a possession, that it",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25.10",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Cn: Heb",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "the Ammonites",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " may be remembered no more among the nations, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and I will execute judgments upon Moab. Then they will know that I am the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.25.11"
            ]
          }
        },
